mber of bags:\n\n$$\n2.40÷80=0.03\n$$\n\nTherefore, the unit price is $$0.03$ per bag." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c071538a-5584-55e9-ae40-92caa0e689bd"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c071538a-5584-55e9-ae40-92caa0e689bd" :answer-field/id #uuid "c071538a-5584-55e9-ae40-92caa0e689bd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-47524270-7e2e-5f9d-bec3-bc1f72531191" :answer-field/choices ["answer-882336d4-b57f-5db1-ae9a-b61362cfe8ec" "answer-47524270-7e2e-5f9d-bec3-bc1f72531191" "answer-2ce0e57e-55ee-5912-862a-d2bcf26aba87" "answer-4b887faa-9241-5a76-b82a-5b70cf7d6a9b" "answer-da89070c-e596-5296-999a-2cd2100803f6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-882336d4-b57f-5db1-ae9a-b61362cfe8ec" :answer/id #uuid "882336d4-b57f-5db1-ae9a-b61362cfe8ec" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.025$ per bag" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47524270-7e2e-5f9d-bec3-bc1f72531191" :answer/id #uuid "47524270-7e2e-5f9d-bec3-bc1f72531191" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.03$ per bag" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2ce0e57e-55ee-5912-862a-d2bcf26aba87" :answer/id #uuid "2ce0e57e-55ee-5912-862a-d2bcf26aba87" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.05$ per bag" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4b887faa-9241-5a76-b82a-5b70cf7d6a9b" :answer/id #uuid "4b887faa-9241-5a76-b82a-5b70cf7d6a9b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.10$ per bag" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da89070c-e596-5296-999a-2cd2100803f6" :answer/id #uuid "da89070c-e596-5296-999a-2cd2100803f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.30$ per bag" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-05c8cffe-2eeb-5afe-9742-13e5b3b2c630" :question/id #uuid "05c8cffe-2eeb-5afe-9742-13e5b3b2c630" :question/math-academy-id "q-354909" :question/problem "At a gourmet shop, a $4$-cup container of artisanal soup costs $$11.20.$ What's the unit price per fluid ounce?\n\nAssume that there are $8$ fluid ounces in one cup." :question/worked-solution "First, we convert from cups to fluid ounces. There are $8$ fluid ounces in each cup, so we multiply the number of cups by $8:$  \n\n$$\n4\\times 8=32\n$$\n\nSo, $4$ cups is the same as $32$ fluid ounces. Now, to find the unit price per fluid ounce, we divide the total price by $32:$  \n\n$$\n11.20÷32=0.35\n$$\n\nTherefore, the artisanal soup costs $$0.35$ per fluid ounce." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7840ac43-4edf-5742-b4b1-5366ca1d4123"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7840ac43-4edf-5742-b4b1-5366ca1d4123" :answer-field/id #uuid "7840ac43-4edf-5742-b4b1-5366ca1d4123" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d90a7558-3beb-5c66-aa72-3f7abf05bf6f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-24047710-b228-5d96-9b5d-e396ce2fb623" "answer-6e10602f-7324-505b-9fd5-7629c190744f" "answer-d90a7558-3beb-5c66-aa72-3f7abf05bf6f" "answer-5a100653-e720-55fb-a7b2-12daca5ba7ad" "answer-5d105737-f5c5-5af0-82e1-e69b96e65bb2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-24047710-b228-5d96-9b5d-e396ce2fb623" :answer/id #uuid "24047710-b228-5d96-9b5d-e396ce2fb623" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.25$ per fluid ounce" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e10602f-7324-505b-9fd5-7629c190744f" :answer/id #uuid "6e10602f-7324-505b-9fd5-7629c190744f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.30$ per fluid ounce" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d90a7558-3beb-5c66-aa72-3f7abf05bf6f" :answer/id #uuid "d90a7558-3beb-5c66-aa72-3f7abf05bf6f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.35$ per fluid ounce" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5a100653-e720-55fb-a7b2-12daca5ba7ad" :answer/id #uuid "5a100653-e720