 divide the number of ounces by $16:$     \n\n$$\n80÷16=5\n$$\n\nSo, $80$ ounces is the same as $5$ pounds. Now, to find the unit price per pound, we divide the total price by $5:$ \n\n$$\n45.60÷5=9.12\n$$\n\nTherefore, the spices cost $$9.12$ per pound." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-26bbc1b2-513a-5ed8-8d12-f14104359b36"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-26bbc1b2-513a-5ed8-8d12-f14104359b36" :answer-field/id #uuid "26bbc1b2-513a-5ed8-8d12-f14104359b36" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-487fd89e-e1d0-52fb-8307-e15d8b284aa0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2ba9a5e4-76a7-501d-a2a3-d2bb93ec1427" "answer-081f659b-8624-5b9b-989e-42fbc2e410fa" "answer-23f69f50-a53b-5f9a-ac59-d504d7890862" "answer-487fd89e-e1d0-52fb-8307-e15d8b284aa0" "answer-dd227569-9234-512c-9803-3479e03530a9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2ba9a5e4-76a7-501d-a2a3-d2bb93ec1427" :answer/id #uuid "2ba9a5e4-76a7-501d-a2a3-d2bb93ec1427" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$0.57$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-081f659b-8624-5b9b-989e-42fbc2e410fa" :answer/id #uuid "081f659b-8624-5b9b-989e-42fbc2e410fa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$8.50$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23f69f50-a53b-5f9a-ac59-d504d7890862" :answer/id #uuid "23f69f50-a53b-5f9a-ac59-d504d7890862" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$8.85$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-487fd89e-e1d0-52fb-8307-e15d8b284aa0" :answer/id #uuid "487fd89e-e1d0-52fb-8307-e15d8b284aa0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$9.12$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd227569-9234-512c-9803-3479e03530a9" :answer/id #uuid "dd227569-9234-512c-9803-3479e03530a9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$9.50$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-af7b9054-324a-5b9b-bc1b-f5ed085967ba" :question/id #uuid "af7b9054-324a-5b9b-bc1b-f5ed085967ba" :question/math-academy-id "q-354932" :question/problem "Sarah bought $1$ ounce of scented soap and paid $$1.25$ for it. What's the unit price per pound?\n\nAssume that there are $16$ ounces in one pound." :question/worked-solution "First, notice that there are $16$ ounces in each pound.  \n\nSince the price is $$1.25$ per ounce, to find the price per pound, we multiply by $16:$\n\n$$\n1.25\\times 16=20\n$$\n\nTherefore, the scented soap costs $$20$ per pound." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-33674337-be94-5894-82e0-a801cce41b18"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-33674337-be94-5894-82e0-a801cce41b18" :answer-field/id #uuid "33674337-be94-5894-82e0-a801cce41b18" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8f36fd1f-8875-5422-aadc-3005fb55784a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-050fa726-2681-5eee-a791-6c3774b790f3" "answer-cddde3a2-7c00-5846-b596-1d52b17d11ae" "answer-8f36fd1f-8875-5422-aadc-3005fb55784a" "answer-8e2b2b93-6dcd-535e-ba5a-8e58eb67c446" "answer-531a5fbe-a36d-5dbb-932a-1bb013b3395e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-050fa726-2681-5eee-a791-6c3774b790f3" :answer/id #uuid "050fa726-2681-5eee-a791-6c3774b790f3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$16$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cddde3a2-7c00-5846-b596-1d52b17d11ae" :answer/id #uuid "cddde3a2-7c00-5846-b596-1d52b17d11ae" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$18$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8f36fd1f-8875-5422-aadc-3005fb55784a" :answer/id #uuid "8f36fd1f-8875-5422-aadc-3005fb55784a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$20$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8e2b2b93-6dcd-535e-ba5a-8e58eb67c446" :answer/id #uuid "8e2b2b93-6dcd-535e-ba